        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Musculoso. Timburr sempre carrega uma viga de madeira e ajuda em construções. Conforme cresce, passa a usar peças maiores. Ele luta balançando a madeira e está perto de evoluir quando consegue manusear vigas pesadas sem dificuldade.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Humanoide &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 75% M / 25% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Timburr pode evoluir para Gurdurr no nível 9 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Leer, Pound</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Focus Energy</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Bide</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Low Kick</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Rock Throw</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Wake-Up Slap</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Chip Away, Slam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Bulk Up</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Rock Slide</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Dynamic Punch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Scary Face</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Hammer Arm</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Focus Punch, Stone Edge, Superpower</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Attract, Block, Brick Break, Brutal Swing, Bulk Up, Close Combat, Coaching, Confide, Curse, Dig, Double Team, Double-Edge, Drain Punch, Endure, Facade, Fire Punch, Fling, Focus Blast, Focus Punch, Frustration, Grass Knot, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Ice Punch, Knock Off, Low Kick, Low Sweep, Mega Kick, Mega Punch, Payback, Poison Jab, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Retaliate, Return, Revenge, Reversal, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Round, Scary Face, Sleep Talk, Smack Down, Snore, Stone Edge, Substitute, Sunny Day, Superpower, Swagger, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder Punch, Toxic, Work Up</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Comet Punch, Counter, Defog, Detect, Drain Punch, Endure, Force Palm, Foresight, Mach Punch, Power-Up Punch, Reversal, Smelling Salts, Wide Guard</p>",
